This is a new React/TypeScript application. The engine preparation scripts and
engine-bridge/opensysml overlays were adapted from DynamicalSystemsGroup/sysml_ide
at source revision bdb85e2341ba5a1a7ce3c6fab4f056c5cb6bca18, retaining the Apache-2.0
license. Application code and legacy repository structure were not imported wholesale.

